      "classification": "STATIC_SOURCE_FACT",
      "finding": "Flattened FP32 tensor dot products, norms, signs and top-magnitude statistics measure parameter/Frobenius geometry. These APIs receive no activation second moment. delta_analysis clamps its norm denominator at 1e-30; adapter-pair metrics return None for zero norms. Their zero-delta conventions differ.",
